text:
You did everything correctly structurally.  
It failed because Bootstrap’s `.table` styles apply background color on the **cells** (`td`), not effectively on the `tr`, so your row-level color gets hidden.

Use this selector instead:


```css
.assets-grid tbody tr:nth-child(even) > td {
  background-color: #e8f5e9;
}
```


If needed, make it stronger:


```css
.assets-grid tbody tr:nth-child(even) > td {
  background-color: #e8f5e9 !important;
}
```


Your table class in `Views/Assets/Index.cshtml` is already correct (`table assets-grid`).

